# 📄 Dosya Yolu: /turkuazvm/.gitignore
# 📌 Amac: TurkuazVM repository icinde uretilen ve lokal kalan dosyalari Git disinda tutar
# 📌 Modul - GitIgnore
# Version: 0.41.4
# Aciklama: Rust build, validation artefact, Windows distribution stage, Python cache, IDE ve runtime verilerini repository disinda tutar
# Bagimli Oldugu Katman: Tool

/target/
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.log
/runtime/
/data/

/secrets/
/packages/**/*.apk
/artifacts/
/apps/desktop/src-tauri/distribution/windows/stage/
/.turkuazvm/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
